hpc:Job a owl:Class .

hpc:UID rdf:type owl:DatatypeProperty ;
    rdfs:domain hpc:Job ;
    rdfs:range xsd:integer .

hpc:Name rdf:type owl:ObjectProperty ;
    rdfs:domain hpc:Job .

hpc:QUEUE rdf:type owl:ObjectProperty ;
    rdfs:domain hpc:Job ;
    rdfs:range hpc:Queue .

hpc:SUBMIT_TIME rdf:type owl:DatatypeProperty ;
    rdfs:domain hpc:Job ;
    rdfs:range xsd:dateTime .

hpc:CPU_T rdf:type owl:DatatypeProperty ;
    rdfs:domain hpc:Job ;
    rdfs:range xsd:decimal .

hpc:WAIT rdf:type owl:DatatypeProperty ;
    rdfs:domain hpc:Job ;
    rdfs:range xsd:decimal .

hpc:TURNAROUND rdf:type owl:DatatypeProperty ;
    rdfs:domain hpc:Job ;
    rdfs:range xsd:decimal .

hpc:FROM rdf:type owl:ObjectProperty ;
    rdfs:domain hpc:Job .

hpc:EXEC_ON rdf:type owl:ObjectProperty ;
    rdfs:domain hpc:Job ;
    rdfs:range hpc:Host .

hpc:JOB_NAME rdf:type owl:ObjectProperty ;
    rdfs:domain hpc:Job .


This ontology fragment defines classes for Job and Host, and object properties for the various job statistics. The datatype properties define the data types for the values of these properties. The domain of each property specifies the class(es) that the property can be applied to.
